From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Norman Herms <dockseed@proton.me>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 20:33:32 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: dt-bindings: sun4i-spdif: Add the Allwinner A733

The S/PDIF (OWA) block of the A733 has the control register of the
A523 one and, like it, separate TX and RX module clocks with a single
reset. Add a compatible with the A523 as fallback.

Tested on Radxa Cubie A7S: booted on two boards; the OWA node with this
compatible binds sun4i-spdif and plays 48 kHz and 44.1 kHz, which the
SoC's own receiver takes in with every window clean and the channel
status intact. The OWA pins PB7 and PB8 reach the header J6, but
nothing is attached there, so the stream is proven inside the SoC only.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/sound/allwinner,sun4i-a10-spdif.yaml   | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/allwinner,sun4i-a10-spdif.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/allwinner,sun4i-a10-spdif.yaml
index 1d089ba70f45..3679b6f2979e 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/allwinner,sun4i-a10-spdif.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/allwinner,sun4i-a10-spdif.yaml
@@ -30,6 +30,9 @@ properties:
       - items:
           - const: allwinner,sun50i-a64-spdif
           - const: allwinner,sun8i-h3-spdif
+      - items:
+          - const: allwinner,sun60i-a733-spdif
+          - const: allwinner,sun55i-a523-spdif
 
   reg:
     maxItems: 1
